  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "For the past 2-ish weeks (when the avatar arm calibration update came out) I've not been able to use all my hand gestures in game. It seems to recognize fist only. \nA friend using Quest 2 link with steam client had gestures working just fine, so it seems like its related to the oculus PC client specifically. (Its not an avatar issue since it happens with every avatar including default row too).\n\nEDIT: This issue only seems to happen in VR, desktop mode is fine for me. But the VR version is still broken as of 21st June.",
